# Install under /opt/we-report-notify (make go-install), edit config.yaml, then:
#   crontab -e
# and paste (or merge) the line below.
#
# One-shot: read report.txt, post, truncate, exit. Does not watch for file changes.
# For a long-running watcher with restart-on-failure, use we-report-notify.service.example.
* * * * * /opt/we-report-notify/we-report-notify -cron
